From 03b4a23dfe14356ff253a8319a24ede64c6e5a3c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex <05jeelo30@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 23:35:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] GameSpace: Build without the LineageOS SDK

AOSPA doesn't ship the LineageOS SDK, so:
- Use the platform gson module instead of the crDroid prebuilt.
- Make the three finger screenshot setting a no-op.
- Drop the bypass charging toggle, which needs the Lineage health HAL.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QY97AsgNLyAwQpzrsxC9zt
---
 app/src/main/Android.bp                       |  4 +-
 .../SystemSettingSwitchPreference.java        | 54 -------------------
 .../gamespace/data/SystemSettings.kt          | 15 ++----
 .../gamespace/hub/HubSettingsActivity.kt      |  2 -
 app/src/main/res/xml/root_preferences.xml     |  6 ---
 5 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 76 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 app/src/main/java/com/crdroid/settings/preferences/SystemSettingSwitchPreference.java

